<view class="container {{elder ? 'elder' : ''}}">
  <!-- 首屏 hero -->
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-icon">🔍</view>
    <view class="hero-title">这条消息，是真的假的？</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">把收到的话贴进来，马上告诉你真真假假、为什么、该怎么办</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card input-card">
    <textarea
      class="input"
      placeholder="长按粘贴，或手动输入。例：群里说吃大蒜能治感冒，是真的吗？"
      placeholder-class="ph"
      value="{{text}}"
      bindinput="onInput"
      maxlength="5000"
      auto-height
    ></textarea>

    <view class="counter {{text.length > 4500 ? 'warn' : ''}}">{{text.length}}/5000</view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="chip" bindtap="onPaste">📋 粘贴</view>
      <view wx:if="{{text}}" class="chip ghost" bindtap="onClear">清空</view>
      <view class="spacer"></view>
      <view class="type-tag" wx:if="{{type}}">识别为：{{typeLabel}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="examples">
    <view class="ex-title muted">不会弄？点下面的例子试试：</view>
    <scroll-view class="ex-scroll" scroll-x="true" enable-flex="true">
      <view class="ex" bindtap="onPick" data-t="群里说吃大蒜能治感冒，是真的吗？">🧄 吃大蒜治感冒</view>
      <view class="ex" bindtap="onPick" data-t="【中国移动】您的积分即将过期，点击 aaa.com 兑换现金">💰 积分兑换短信</view>
      <view class="ex" bindtap="onPick" data-t="震惊！这家医院瞒报疫情，内部人员爆料…">😱 惊悚标题党</view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary submit" disabled="{{!text || submitting}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
    {{submitting ? '正在提交…' : '帮我看看'}}
  </button>

  <view class="tip muted">
    本结论由人工智能生成，仅供参考，请以官方通报为准。涉及钱、验证码、链接，拿不准就打 96110。
  </view>
</view>
